 src/remote/launcher.rs | 108 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------------
 src/remote/windows.rs  |   6 ++-
 2 files changed, 81 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/remote/launcher.rs b/src/remote/launcher.rs
